(Joiner, Mover, Leaver Requirements) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(New access requests require an approved ticket before provisioning.) Tj
T*
(Role changes require manager approval and removal of unnecessary prior access.) Tj
T*
(Terminated user access must be removed within 24 hours of HR notification.) Tj
T*
(The service desk records the termination access removal SLA in the ticket notes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Exceptions) Tj
T*
(Any extension for legal hold or investigation must be documented by Security.) Tj
T*
(Shared accounts are prohibited unless approved by the Information Security Lead.) Tj
T*
